---
import { OFFICIAL_PHONE, OFFICIAL_PHONE_DISPLAY, OFFICIAL_EMAIL, OFFICIAL_ADDRESS } from '@/utils/links';
---
<footer class="bg-surface-soft border-t-2 border-green-primary py-12 text-ink">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-border-base">
      <!-- Kolom 1: Perusahaan & Logo -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="CV. Serba Niaga Jaya" class="h-10 w-auto object-contain">
        <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
          Pemasok material konstruksi dan infrastruktur terpadu berstandar SNI dan Bina Marga untuk kebutuhan kontraktor dan mandor Jabodetabek.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Kolom 2: Kategori Material -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-ink tracking-wider">Kategori Material</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-ink opacity-80">
          <li><a href="/produk/beton" class="hover:text-green-primary">Beton Ready Mix & Precast</a></li>
          <li><a href="/produk/baja" class="hover:text-green-primary">Baja Tulangan Polos & Ulir</a></li>
          <li><a href="/produk/aspal" class="hover:text-green-primary">Aspal Hotmix AC-WC & AC-BC</a></li>
          <li><a href="/produk/batuan" class="hover:text-green-primary">Pasir Cor, Pasang & Split 1/2</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Kolom 3: Jalur Resmi -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-ink tracking-wider">Jalur Resmi</h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-ink opacity-80">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-gray-500">WhatsApp Teknis:</span>
            <a href={`https://wa.me/${OFFICIAL_PHONE}`} class="font-mono font-bold text-ink hover:underline">{OFFICIAL_PHONE_DISPLAY}</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-gray-500">Email BoQ / Penawaran:</span>
            <a href={`mailto:${OFFICIAL_EMAIL}`} class="font-mono text-ink hover:underline break-all">{OFFICIAL_EMAIL}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kolom 4: Alamat & Wilayah Layanan -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-ink tracking-wider">Kantor Operasional</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
          {OFFICIAL_ADDRESS}
        </p>
        <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-green-primary uppercase">Jangkauan Armada:</span>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-ink opacity-70 leading-relaxed">
          DKI Jakarta, Bogor, Depok, Tangerang, Bekasi, Cikarang & Karawang.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Baris Pernyataan Integritas Terbawah -->
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-ink opacity-70">
      <div>
        &copy; 2026 CV. Serba Niaga Jaya. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.
      </div>
      <div class="text-center sm:text-right font-medium">
        Kepatuhan Spesifikasi Teknis Standar SNI, ASTM & Bina Marga PUPR.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
